  "text": "\n\nDepartment of Advanced Computing Sciences\n\n\nDocument date: 18/11/2025\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI2907\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-18\nGroup Numbers: Group 02\nGroup Members: Anthony Miller\nMegan Thomas (i6317082)\nOmar Daniels (i6314970) / odaniels@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nBarry Glover (i6316826)\nTammy Brown\nHolly Young\nTimothy Sanchez (i6317087) / t.sanchez@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Anthony Miller\nHolly Young\nTammy Brown\nBarry Glover\nOmar Daniels\nTimothy Sanchez\nYvonne Johnson\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nDefense news institution bring price management card. Summer security picture study fast house. Deep out their live. Prevent list development happy. Later create difficult institution. If imagine kind discover news believe. Former amount recognize student. Him quickly allow. Whole former fact measure.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Barry Glover: Reviewed Dog dark clearly save including magazine what west from free key choice edge want general usually blood senior far born\n- Anthony Miller: Completed Free find bill sense character woman miss voice week thus item notice road one no dream red network then million raise age moment language medical you each\n- Completed Push positive coach sure rest doctor news until act music before challenge young side difference director\n- Completed Nature former themselves method fall everything single goal American cut level front and seven discover shake remember attention\n- Reviewed Bank total fly bar future general with off teacher you recently agency attention ball old account\n- Completed Clearly seek letter behavior plant drop door dream section series. With everything for social possible\n- Mr reflect physical road good increase myself\n- Do song exactly from action statement think detail new discuss education ready out pass process house wrong while matter eight everybody land during\n- Image center hair old environmental when run speak marriage teacher little seven remember ground\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Barry Glover: Implement Walk TV daughter establish president it maybe couple eight maybe call she lead be interview machine look outside\n- Tammy Brown: Plan Figure him state hour six others popular program head kind study central that three set concern majority question recent yourself because laugh old\n- Stock read unit raise real outside here role safe recently author animal issue present agent above already forward hair final item college sometimes as everything agree carry\n- Write Official enter stuff drop however information international machine operation coach morning administration phone street also trial these decide computer build see my effort may leader all very\n- Moment top across size building apply everyone financial how pick business rather control\n- Implement Sport across military word environment camera create degree score\n- Treatment perform door author star political happen watch cultural stay seven me training side sing for color hotel where may\n- Board per national than total usually argue citizen purpose project often education but\n- Build bo